---
// Philosophy — Technical Growth & The Person
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
  <!-- Section header -->
  <div class="mb-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[var(--text-faint)] mb-4">
      The Person
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">
      Philosophy
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 md:gap-8">
    <!-- Quote / Statement -->
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <blockquote class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] leading-snug italic">
        "A pragmatist by experience, an architect by design."
      </blockquote>
      <div class="w-12 h-px bg-[var(--border-primary)] mt-8"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Technical Growth -->
    <div class="md:col-span-7 md:pl-8 lg:pl-12">
      <h3 class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[var(--text-faint)] mb-8">
        Technical Growth
      </h3>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
        <p>
          The journey started as a Fullstack/Sysadmin generalist in a small
          team—wearing every hat, solving every problem, building the instinct
          to understand systems end-to-end.
        </p>
        <p>
          That generalist foundation became the launchpad for specialization.
          Moving to Lisbon meant moving deeper: from "make it work" to "make it
          right." From reactive firefighting to deliberate backend architecture.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, the focus is building software that is as stable as it is
          scalable. Not chasing the newest framework—choosing the proven tool,
          designing the resilient system, writing the code that someone else
          can maintain at 3 a.m.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Timeline markers -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--border-primary)] grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 transition-colors duration-500">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--text-faint)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Then</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Fullstack Generalist · Sysadmin · Small Team</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--text-faint)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Now</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Backend Specialist · Systems Architect · Lisbon</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
